(7651419, 1244816, 173844, '<td valign="top">A glimmer that conjures the whole.  As if the whole is overwhelming, and it is.  Can''t say enough about elephants, words can''t do them justice.  That they''re threatened by sordid desires can''t be left unsaid at the moment.  Here is a powerful tribute, or portrait, or poem, tones and form gathered in the opening notes of a symphony.  Delivers the sense both of the monumental and the tenuous.  The inkiness is astounding.<br/>Co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A glimmer that conjures the whole.  As if the whole is overwhelming, and it is.  Can''t say enough about elephants, words can''t do them justice.  That they''re threatened by sordid desires can''t be left unsaid at the moment.  Here is a powerful tribute, or portrait, or poem, tones and form gathered in the opening notes of a symphony.  Delivers the sense both of the monumental and the tenuous.  The inkiness is astounding.Co-favorite of the challenge.', '2020-01-23 20:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651422, 1244882, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even without the overhead paths of sunlight, this is a virtuosic performance.  Those horizontal paths do seem like sunlight, and they serve to draw us into the sensuality of the day, the scene, the moment.  They also bring out the dreaminess, the incompletion of the moment.  I think both can obtain.  The black and white processing is terrific.  I love it all, but am especially drawn to the upper reaches of the image where what seem to be crowds stretch out to seeming infinity.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Even without the overhead paths of sunlight, this is a virtuosic performance.  Those horizontal paths do seem like sunlight, and they serve to draw us into the sensuality of the day, the scene, the moment.  They also bring out the dreaminess, the incompletion of the moment.  I think both can obtain.  The black and white processing is terrific.  I love it all, but am especially drawn to the upper reaches of the image where what seem to be crowds stretch out to seeming infinity.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2020-01-23 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651423, 1244759, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful, wondrously joyous image!  The colors alone are a treat.  The swags of fabric on the lines across the waterway must dance deliriously in the breeze, and too bad we can''t see it but in our imagination.  The water is a pointillist reflection of the fabric, which in turn allows the ripples through in their translucence.  Fine art, so enjoyable.</td>', 'What a beautiful, wondrously joyous image!  The colors alone are a treat.  The swags of fabric on the lines across the waterway must dance deliriously in the breeze, and too bad we can''t see it but in our imagination.  The water is a pointillist reflection of the fabric, which in turn allows the ripples through in their translucence.  Fine art, so enjoyable.', '2020-01-23 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651425, 1244886, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it seems the environment brings life to the people inhabiting it, sometimes vice versa.  This is vice versa.  It''s children who give themselves entirely to the moment, as here.  At least most easily.  And not to dismiss the flat open plain behind them.  Here''s where a camera can capture a transient instant so memory becomes a jewel.  Beautifully found and done.</td>', 'Sometimes it seems the environment brings life to the people inhabiting it, sometimes vice versa.  This is vice versa.  It''s children who give themselves entirely to the moment, as here.  At least most easily.  And not to dismiss the flat open plain behind them.  Here''s where a camera can capture a transient instant so memory becomes a jewel.  Beautifully found and done.', '2020-01-23 21:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651427, 1244580, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming and utterly satisfying.  A good eye finds serendipity, animates the overlooked canvas of the day.  The colors are sumptuous, especially the ultramarine, or is it cobalt, on the bottom.  Thanks for this.</td>', 'Charming and utterly satisfying.  A good eye finds serendipity, animates the overlooked canvas of the day.  The colors are sumptuous, especially the ultramarine, or is it cobalt, on the bottom.  Thanks for this.', '2020-01-23 21:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
