(7651449, 1244790, 173844, '<td valign="top">That''s water and a shoreline, and maybe that''s the sky, but I''m just not sure.  In any case it''s kind of dazzling, even opalescent, and it''s fine stuff.  It''s an abstraction of nature using its own materials, if that makes any sense.  What an interesting world.</td>', 'That''s water and a shoreline, and maybe that''s the sky, but I''m just not sure.  In any case it''s kind of dazzling, even opalescent, and it''s fine stuff.  It''s an abstraction of nature using its own materials, if that makes any sense.  What an interesting world.', '2020-01-23 22:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651450, 1244874, 173844, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Mr. Rogers Neighborhood, but real and living and it''s up to you to take it from there.  It''s elating, and perhaps that trolley will travel to where everything''s fresh and fun.  If only.  But beautifully done and emotionally poignant.</td>', 'Reminds me of Mr. Rogers Neighborhood, but real and living and it''s up to you to take it from there.  It''s elating, and perhaps that trolley will travel to where everything''s fresh and fun.  If only.  But beautifully done and emotionally poignant.', '2020-01-23 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
