(7651540, 1244759, 64844, '<td valign="top">Really???<br/>Well, I didn''t see this coming! <br/>So, pretty much "everything" is allowed in standard editing but not that slight tilt to create a double exposure. Yes, now I saw that little text in the brackets. Why isn''t something so fundamental mentioned in "you may not" That where the eyes go while checking the rules.<br/>Is this discouraging? YES very much so!<br/> <br/>Thank you anyways for the friendly comments!!!</td>', 'Really???Well, I didn''t see this coming! So, pretty much "everything" is allowed in standard editing but not that slight tilt to create a double exposure. Yes, now I saw that little text in the brackets. Why isn''t something so fundamental mentioned in "you may not" That where the eyes go while checking the rules.Is this discouraging? YES very much so! Thank you anyways for the friendly comments!!!', '2020-01-24 02:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
