(7651718, 1244689, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wow Alessio your "Shape of Nature" is spectacular! Glad you posted it. <br/>Some look like animal skin, flamboyant surfaces engraved in our memory but continuing to float their mesmerizing ways. <br/> <br/>Separated from the context, The Mountain loses its grandeur for me. <br/>But I agree completely on color for this project; the color makes it. <br/>Brava<br/></td>', 'Wow Alessio your "Shape of Nature" is spectacular! Glad you posted it. Some look like animal skin, flamboyant surfaces engraved in our memory but continuing to float their mesmerizing ways.  Separated from the context, The Mountain loses its grandeur for me. But I agree completely on color for this project; the color makes it. Brava', '2020-01-27 11:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
